Include the dependencies of the public dyld image types directly.

Sources: dyld-1323.3 (637911768f664e38e7e50b4fbf17e303e14fdc01) and
dyld-1378 (fd8d0c4d52320ebf64db34f3cb280310d905c5ae), include/mach-o/dyld_images.h.
Scope: macOS SDK 26.0 and 26.5, arm64 and x86_64.

The raw header uses uintptr_t, fixed-width integers, and Mach types without
including the headers that declare them. A direct Clang include reproduces
the unknown uintptr_t error on both targets. The existing patch supplies
the prerequisites while retaining the image layout.

Evidence: .agents/skills/review-macos-c-sdk/scripts/sdk_review/headers/fixtures/c_interfaces/dyld_images_layout.c and
.agents/skills/review-macos-c-sdk/scripts/sdk_review/headers/data/macosx26.5/ranked-header-differences.md.

--- a/usr/include/mach-o/dyld_images.h
+++ b/usr/include/mach-o/dyld_images.h
@@ -22,6 +22,8 @@
  */
 #ifndef _DYLD_IMAGES_
 #define _DYLD_IMAGES_
+#include <stdint.h>
+#include <mach/mach.h>
 
 #include <stdbool.h>
 #include <uuid/uuid.h>
